==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|ru|недѣ́ля}} {{ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|orv|ru}} {{term|недѣля||Sunday|lang=orv}}, equivalent to {{l|ru|не}} + {{term|делать|де́лая|no working|lang=ru|sc=Cyrl}}, originally used to mean [[Sunday]], the day of rest (Old Church Slavonic {{term|недѣлꙗ|sc=Cyrs||not doing|lang=cu}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/nʲɪˈdʲelʲə/|lang=ru}}
* {{audio|Ru-неделя.ogg|Audio}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun|неде́ля|f-in|неде́ли|неде́ли}}

# [[week]]
#:* {{l|ru|в}} неделю — ''per week''
#:* {{l|ru|на}} [[прошлый|прошлой]] неделе — ''last week''
#:* на [[этот|этой]] неделе — ''this week''
#:* на [[будущий|будущей]] неделе — ''next week''
# {{cx|obsolete|lang=ru}} [[Sunday]]

